 "ContrastLightAndDark": {
  "caption": "A: every pair of text and ground with its ratio; the fixes applied to the kit.",
  "html": "<div class=\"st-ex\"><div class=\"st-s wide\"><div class=\"st-board\">\n    <div class=\"scroll\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-stack\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;width:1224px\">\n<div class=\"pbx-ax-pair\">\n  <div class=\"k pbx-ax-col\">\n    <p class=\"cap\">Dark, with its fixes</p>\n    <div class=\"pbx-ax-sec\">Pane headers: focused and working, waiting on you, done with the tools on hover</div>\n    <div class=\"mini pbx-ax-mini pbx-ax-foc\"><div class=\"ph sel ink\"><svg class=\"pi\"><use href=\"#p-claude\"/></svg><span class=\"nm\"><span class=\"shim\">Kylo-ren</span></span><span class=\"bd\">herdr-kanso</span><span class=\"bd\"><svg class=\"i i12\"><use href=\"#lu-git-branch\"/></svg>app-audit</span><span class=\"dg\"><span class=\"seg dg stale\">3 files <span class=\"pm\">+42 −7</span></span><span class=\"seg\"><i class=\"dot d-work\"></i>#166 · checks running</span></span><span class=\"flex\"></span><svg class=\"m m-work\"><use href=\"#e-work\"/></svg><svg class=\"i i14 grip\"><use href=\"#lu-grip-vertical\"/></svg></div></div>\n    <div class=\"mini pbx-ax-mini\"><div class=\"ph blk ink pbx-ax-blk\"><svg class=\"pi\"><use href=\"#p-claude\"/></svg><span class=\"nm\">Fury</span><span class=\"bd\">~/herdr-kanso</span><span class=\"bd\"><svg class=\"i i12\"><use href=\"#lu-git-branch\"/></svg>cart-retry</span><span class=\"dg\"><span class=\"seg\">1 file <span class=\"pm\">+22 −0</span></span></span><span class=\"flex\"></span><span class=\"needs\"><svg class=\"m m-blk\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg></span><svg class=\"i i14 grip\"><use href=\"#lu-grip-vertical\"/></svg></div></div>\n    <div class=\"mini pbx-ax-mini\"><div class=\"ph\"><svg class=\"pi\"><use href=\"#p-claude\"/></svg><span class=\"nm\">tests</span><span class=\"bd\">~/kansō</span><span class=\"bd\"><svg class=\"i i12\"><use href=\"#lu-git-branch\"/></svg>limiter-tests</span><span class=\"dg\"><span class=\"seg\">1 file <span class=\"pm\">+74 −0</span></span><span class=\"seg\">2 commits</span></span><span class=\"flex\"></span><span class=\"tools\"><span class=\"t\"><svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#lu-panel-left\"/></svg></span><span class=\"t\" style=\"background:var(--w7);color:var(--fg)\"><svg class=\"i\"><use href=\"#lu-panels-top-left\"/></svg></span></span><svg class=\"m m-done\"><use href=\"#e-done\"/></svg><svg class=\"i i14 grip\"><use href=\"#lu-grip-vertical\"/></svg></div></div>\n    <div class=\"pbx-ax-grid\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-ax-side\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-ax-sec\">Sidebar rows</div><div class=\"w1-r proj on\"><span class=\"n\">kansō</span><span class=\"tl\">herdr-kanso<i class=\"g\"></i><svg class=\"i \"><use href=\"#lu-git-branch\"/></svg><span class=\"b\">main</span><i class=\"g\"></i><span class=\"b\">↓12</span></span><span class=\"sp\"></span></div><div class=\"w1-r ag two l1 live blk\"><svg class=\"i ld\"><use href=\"#lu-terminal\"/></svg><span class=\"w1-n2\"><span class=\"n\">Fury</span><span class=\"act\">Run npm publish? <span class=\"tm\">· 2m</span></span></span><svg class=\"m m-blk\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg></div><div class=\"w1-r ag two l1 live foc\"><svg class=\"pi ld\"><use href=\"#p-claude\"/></svg><span class=\"w1-n2\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"w1-gl\" style=\"animation-duration:2360ms\">Kylo-ren</span></span><span class=\"act\">Reviewing board 01 <span class=\"tm\">· 3m</span></span></span><svg class=\"m m-work\"><use href=\"#e-work\"/></svg></div><div class=\"w1-r ag l2 sub\"><svg class=\"pi ld\"><use href=\"#p-codex\"/></svg><span class=\"n\">Wren</span><svg class=\"m m-done\"><use href=\"#e-done\"/></svg></div><div class=\"w1-r ag l1\"><svg class=\"i ld\"><use href=\"#lu-terminal\"/></svg><span class=\"n\">Groot</span><svg class=\"m m-idle\"><use href=\"#e-idle\"/></svg></div><div class=\"w1-sbar\" style=\"padding:0 8px\"><span class=\"it\"><svg class=\"m m-blk\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg><span class=\"c-fg\" style=\"font-weight:500\">Fury</span><span class=\"tr\">Run npm publish?</span></span><span class=\"it\"><svg class=\"m m-blk\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg>Memory 8% free</span><span class=\"sp\"></span><span class=\"it\"><svg class=\"m m-work\"><use href=\"#e-work\"/></svg>1 of 4 working</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pbx-ax-pane\">\n        <div class=\"pbx-ax-sec\">Panel rows: rest, hover, selected</div>\n        <div class=\"prow2\"><div class=\"a\" style=\"align-items:center\"><i class=\"dot d-done\"></i><span class=\"tr\">rate-limit-v1</span><span class=\"pbx-ax-v\">412 MB</span></div><div class=\"b\" style=\"padding-left:16px\"><span class=\"c-done\">Merged</span>· 3 d</div></div>\n        <div class=\"prow2\" style=\"background:var(--w7)\"><div class=\"a\" style=\"align-items:center\"><i class=\"dot d-work\"></i><span class=\"tr\">herdr-kanso</span><span class=\"pbx-ax-v\">310 MB</span></div><div class=\"b\" style=\"padding-left:16px\">In a tab: Bix· today</div></div>\n        <div class=\"prow2 sel\"><div class=\"a\" style=\"align-items:center\"><i class=\"dot d-blk\"></i><span class=\"tr\">app-audit</span><span class=\"pbx-ax-v\">380 MB</span></div><div class=\"b\" style=\"padding-left:16px\">2 uncommitted changes· 6 d</div><div class=\"c\" style=\"padding-left:16px\"><span class=\"btn\">Open</span><span class=\"ql kit-act kit-armed\"><span>Remove</span><span>Press again to remove</span></span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-ax-sec\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">Segmented, field with focus, buttons</div>\n        <span class=\"s3 pbx-ax-thumb\"><span class=\"on\">Today</span><span>Month</span><span>30 days</span><span>Year</span></span>\n        <div class=\"kit-field foc\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><span>postgres:17</span><span class=\"pbx-ax-caret\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"acts\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><span class=\"btn\">Send to Kylo-ren</span><span class=\"btn kit-act kit-armed\"><span>Merge</span><span>Press again to merge</span></span><span class=\"ql\">Open on GitHub</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pbx-ax-grid\" style=\"margin-top:16px;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-ax-sec\">Toast</div>\n        <div class=\"kst-toast\"><svg class=\"m m-blk\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg><span class=\"t\">PR #142 · test / unit failed</span><span class=\"kst-btn sm\">Open</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"pbx-ax-sec\">Menu</div>\n        <div class=\"menu\" style=\"width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\"><div class=\"mh\">Pull request · #141</div><div class=\"mi\"><svg class=\"i i14\"><use href=\"#lu-copy\"/></svg>Copy link</div><div class=\"mi hov\"><svg class=\"i i14\"><use href=\"#lu-eye-off\"/></svg>Hide this<span class=\"k\">⌘H</span></div><div class=\"mr\"></div><div class=\"mi\"><svg class=\"i i14\"><use href=\"#lu-sliders-vertical\"/></svg>Settings for this…</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n      <div class=\"k pbx-ax-tabwrap\"><p class=\"cap\">Colour tokens: what each one is for, and the rule it keeps</p><div class=\"scroll\"><table class=\"pbx-t\"><tr><th>Token</th><th>Dark</th><th>Light</th><th>Use it for</th><th>Rule</th></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding-top:16px;color:var(--fg);font-weight:600\">Text</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>fg</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#d8d4cb;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#d8d4cb</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#2a2723;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#2a2723</td><td>Names, rows, prose, typed text, labels on a wash</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Body text. 4.5:1 on every surface, hover and selected included.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>muted</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#b3afa5;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#b3afa5</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#49453d;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#49453d</td><td>Second lines, scope lines, quiet buttons at rest, field hints</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Secondary text. 4.5:1 everywhere. Never for the one thing to read first.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>dim</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#a3a09a;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#a3a09a</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#544f48;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#544f48</td><td>Counts, times, key hints, meta, a disabled label</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Tertiary text. 4.5:1 everywhere. Told from muted by size and place, not by tone alone.</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding-top:16px;color:var(--fg);font-weight:600\">States</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>working</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#c4b07e;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#c4b07e</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#5d4e27;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#5d4e27</td><td>The working ensō and a running check</td><td class=\"c-mu\">One meaning only. 4.5:1 as text, 3:1 as a mark.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>blocked</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#ca938b;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#ca938b</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#6b4642;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#6b4642</td><td>Needs you, a failure, an error edge</td><td class=\"c-mu\">One meaning only. 4.5:1 as text, 3:1 as a mark or an edge.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>done</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#98ad8f;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#98ad8f</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#45543c;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#45543c</td><td>Finished, passed, ready</td><td class=\"c-mu\">One meaning only. 4.5:1 as text, 3:1 as a mark.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>violet</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#ad9cab;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#ad9cab</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#5a4b55;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#5a4b55</td><td>Merged</td><td class=\"c-mu\">One meaning only. 4.5:1 as text, 3:1 as a mark.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>blue</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#93a3b5;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#93a3b5</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#44505e;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#44505e</td><td>Information with no state</td><td class=\"c-mu\">One meaning only. 4.5:1 as text, 3:1 as a mark.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>claude</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#d4876a;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#d4876a</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#a35a3b;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#a35a3b</td><td>The Claude Code mark</td><td class=\"c-mu\">A mark, not text. 3:1 on every surface.</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding-top:16px;color:var(--fg);font-weight:600\">Surfaces</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>canvas</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#161615;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#161615</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#e2ded6;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#e2ded6</td><td>Fields, cards inside a panel</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Behind controls that take input.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>chrome</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#161615;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#161615</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#dbd7ce;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#dbd7ce</td><td>Sidebar, tab bar, status bar</td><td class=\"c-mu\">The window frame.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>bg</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#1b1b19;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#1b1b19</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#ebe8e2;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#ebe8e2</td><td>Panes and panels</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Where work is read.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>popover</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#222220;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#222220</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#f5f2ec;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#f5f2ec</td><td>Menus, toasts, dialogs</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Anything that floats.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>raised</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#262624;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#262624</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#f9f7f3;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#f9f7f3</td><td>The away card, a segmented thumb</td><td class=\"c-mu\">One step above its ground. Never pure white.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>hover</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">7% fg</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">7% fg</td><td>Any row, menu item, icon or quiet button under the pointer</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Foreground at 7% over its ground. Only tone changes.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>selected</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">12% fg</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\">12% fg</td><td>The chosen row, item or tab</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Foreground at 12% over its ground. Hover never replaces it.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>blkwash</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#3d322f;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#3d322f</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#d0c4bf;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#d0c4bf</td><td>The header of a pane that needs you</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Text on it stays fg, muted or dim; a blocked verdict on it is drawn in fg.</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" style=\"padding-top:16px;color:var(--fg);font-weight:600\">Edges and fills</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>input</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#73726d;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#73726d</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#817b72;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#817b72</td><td>The edge of a field, a switch track, any control whose edge is its only outline</td><td class=\"c-mu\">3:1 against its ground.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>border</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#272725;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#272725</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#d8d2c8;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#d8d2c8</td><td>Dividers between areas</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Decoration only. Never the only outline of a control.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>solid / solidfg</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#d8d4cb;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#d8d4cb / <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#161615;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#161615</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#2a2723;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#2a2723 / <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#ebe8e2;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#ebe8e2</td><td>The one primary button</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Label 4.5:1 on the fill, at rest and on hover.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><b>accent / accentfg</b></td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#e88399;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#e88399 / <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#161615;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#161615</td><td class=\"c-mu\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#912845;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#912845 / <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:8px;background:#f5f2ec;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128,128,128,.35)\"></span>#f5f2ec</td><td>An armed control, the focus ring, the focused pane outline</td><td class=\"c-mu\">Label 4.5:1 on the fill. Ring and outline 3:1. Never decoration.</td></tr></table></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div></div></div>"
 }
}
